  "title": "Air Fryer Asparagus Tots",
  "description": "Why not turn fresh asparagus into asparagus tots with the help of your air fryer? Serve on their own or dip them into hollandaise sauce for a yummy snack.",
  "authors": [
    "Soup Loving Nicole"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-04-19T21:15:52-04:00",
